Description: Tools for preparing, validating and analysing temporal
    ecological interaction networks. The package supports weighted,
    binary, directed, undirected, unipartite and multipartite networks,
    and provides methods to quantify interaction rewiring, changes in
    interaction strength and temporal network reorganization.
